It ships none of them, and it is not endorsed by or affiliated with Larian
Studios. You need your own copy of the game.


Third-party code
----------------

wheels/nifgen-2026.9.15+dv2-py3-none-any.whl
    A Python reader for the NetImmerse/Gamebryo file formats, generated from
    the NifTools project's `nif.xml` format specification. The generated
    sources are unchanged; the wheel holds only the NIF reader and the modules
    it imports (`formats/nif`, `formats/base`, `formats/dds`, `utils`), and
    not `utils/mopper.exe`, which only writes collision data.

